[I] A Rust compiler front-end for IDEs

[T] rust-analyzer is a language server that provides IDE features such as
[T] code completion, go to definition, inlay hints and refactorings for Rust
[T] code, for editors that support the Language Server Protocol.

[U] https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-analyzer

[A] https://rust-analyzer.github.io/
[M] Daniel Ashkenazi <daniel.ashkenazi@gmail.com>

